      "name": "Flame Myth",
      "description": "Powers up the moves of all allied sync pairs by [Digit:2digits ]%. Reduces attack move damage taken by all allied sync pairs by [Digit:2digits Idx=\"1\" ]%. The more allied sync pairs with [Name:ReferencedMessageTag Idx=\"2\" ] you have on your team, the higher these percentages are. (Each additional sync pair powers up moves by 10% and reduces damage by 3%. The maximum power-up is [Digit:2digits Idx=\"3\" ]%, and the maximum damage reduction is [Digit:2digits Idx=\"4\" ]%.)",
